// THE WARDEN BREAKING, out in the world (the warden_breaks cutscene): the
// colossal statue before the Hero's Gate (warden_awake in deadcity.js) cracks
// from the plinth up and its eyes go out ('warden_crack', while it says its
// last words); then it comes apart and falls, its sword arm sweeping down, in
// a cloud of stone dust that thins to leave the heap it is from then on
// ('warden_fall'; warden_broken is the room's prop after). 112x80: wide
// enough that the statue, drawn centred on its own tile like any actor, and
// the heap, a tile wider, both land where the room draws them. Each is played
// once and holds its last frame (src/engine/animations.js); 'anim:warden_crack'
// is the statue whole, as a look.

